  "releaseNotes": "Preview release for Windows and .NET Framework 4.8.1. Adds 21 OpenSTAAD load assignment and load-case metadata queries, including inclusive ID ranges, requested-ID filtering and concrete family lists. Includes expanded IntelliSense, load-query documentation, installation and publishing guides. Verified by 342 passing offline tests and 42 executable XML examples in an isolated package consumer. Live STAAD COM behavior, engineering units and supported-version compatibility remain pending validation before a stable release. Full release notes: https://github.com/structuraldeveloper/StaadPro.Interop/blob/main/docs/Release-Notes.md",
